    <node id="&quot;A BRAND NEW ME (DUSTY SPRINGFIELD ALBUM)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Brand New Me (Dusty Springfield album) is the sixth studio album by English singer Dusty Springfield, released on Atlantic Records in January 1970."</data>
